# "Whenever Dain attacks, each equipped ATTACKING creature gains double strike": on turn 3 the Axe is on the first Ornithopter, which
# stays home; Dain and the unequipped second Ornithopter attack and nobody gains double strike (Keywords checked; 1 damage, Bot2 at 19).
# On turn 5 Bot1 moves the Axe ({2}) to the second Ornithopter and attacks with Dain and it: now it, equipped and attacking, has double
# strike (1 x 2) beside Dain's 1 - positive control: Bot2 at 16 - while the first Ornithopter, unequipped and home, has none.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Dáin Ironfoot
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
